senses.gloss:
1. उद्-इत, अस्, आ, अम्, risen, ascended, being above;
high, tall, lofty; grown, augmented, born, produced;
incurred, experienced.
—उदित-होमिन्, ई, इनी, इ, Ved.
sacrificing after sunrise.

उद्-दीप, अस्, m. inflaming, lighting; an inflamer;
animating, who or what animates; (अम्), n. a gummy
and resinous substance, bdellium.
